\textbf{Scaling decision} & Threshold-based: $\rho > 0.80$ scale-up, $\rho < 0.30$ scale-down & INFaaS cost-model: Strategy A (sum of model load costs) vs B (fastest variant only), configurable threshold (default 1.5$\times$) \\
