\textbf{Autoscaler backend} & Pure Python decision loop; C++ limited to gRPC stubs (\path{client.cc}, \path{heartbeat_client.cc}) & Same Python-only architecture; INFaaS cost model (\path{compute_model_cost()}, \path{compute_fastest_model_cost()}) is pure Python; no C++ autoscaler component \\
